# The interpretune commit these examples are validated against. CI installs interpretune from this commit with its
# supported flow (the `examples` and `lightning` extras, the `git-deps` and `test` groups); the scheduled run also
# tests against interpretune `main`, and the bump workflow opens a pull request that moves this pin. It becomes a
# release version once interpretune publishes one that carries what the tutorials use.
